fog|low-cloud|NOUN|cloud near the ground|Cloud close to the ground that makes distant objects difficult to see.|sương mù|Fog hid the opposite bank until the morning wind cleared it.|Sương mù che khuất bờ bên kia cho tới khi gió buổi sáng xua tan nó.|Usually uncountable; thick fog or a bank of fog. A fog may refer to a particular occurrence or a figurative state.|-
lifelong|whole-life|ADJECTIVE|lasting for a whole life|Lasting throughout a person's life.|suốt đời; cả đời|Her lifelong interest in birds began with a notebook of garden sightings.|Mối quan tâm suốt đời của bà đối với chim bắt đầu từ một cuốn sổ ghi những lần thấy chim trong vườn.|Usually before a noun, as in lifelong friend or lifelong learning; write it as one word.|0
park|public-green-area|NOUN|public area for outdoor recreation|An area of open land where people can walk, relax, or enjoy outdoor activities.|công viên|The park has a quiet path beside the old canal.|Công viên có một con đường yên tĩnh bên cạnh con kênh cũ.|Countable; in a park for location. This green-space sense differs from a car park or a wildlife park.|0
park|leave-a-vehicle|VERB|stop and leave a vehicle|To put a vehicle in a place and leave it there for a time.|đỗ; đậu xe|We parked the van behind the theatre to unload the costumes.|Chúng tôi đỗ xe tải nhỏ phía sau nhà hát để dỡ trang phục xuống.|Transitive park a vehicle, or intransitive park in a place. Parking names the activity or available vehicle space.|1
throw|send-through-the-air|VERB|send through the air by hand|To make something move through the air by moving your hand and letting it go.|ném; quăng|She threw the soft ball across the circle to Minh.|Cô ấy ném quả bóng mềm qua vòng người cho Minh.|Transitive throw something to someone for transfer, or at something as a target. Past threw; past participle thrown.|0
zip|close-with-a-zipper|VERB|fasten using a zipper|To fasten clothing or a container by moving its zipper closed.|kéo khóa; đóng khóa kéo|Nam zipped his jacket before stepping into the windy street.|Nam kéo khóa áo khoác trước khi bước ra con phố lộng gió.|Transitive zip something or zip something up; zipped and zipping double p. Unzip means open the fastening.|-
